flowchart LR
    A[Register initial source artifact] --> B[Generate candidate PPTX]
    B --> C[Collect validation evidence]
    C --> D[Assess fidelity, editability, and loss]
    D --> E{Reviewer decides:<br/>accept or request revision?}

    E -->|Accept| F[Mark candidate accepted]
    F --> G[Deliver PPTX + report]

    E -->|Request revision| H[Create revision request bundle]
    H --> I[Run revision workflow]
    I --> J[Register revised source artifact]
    J -->|Next revision iteration| B
